<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei","Source Han Sans SC","Noto Sans SC",sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>换个划分方式重跑，结论不变吗？——四种重采样交叉确认</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.75)' }}>CRT 应答预测 · AI 模型基准对比</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 18, paddingBottom: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 720 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: '100%', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: 12 }}>
        <Image src="assets/robustness.png" style={{ width: 615, height: 320, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4, textAlign: 'center' }}>四种重采样方案下的 AUC：LOOCV（留一法）· 蒙特卡洛 100 次留出 · Bootstrap 乐观度校正（200 次自抽样）</Text>
      <Table
        style={{ width: '100%', height: 156, marginTop: 10 }}
        defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 14.5, textAlign: 'center', color: '#1A2230' }}
        defaultCellStyle={{
          border: {
            left: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
            right: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
            top: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
            bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
          },
        }}
        cells={[
          [
            { text: '模型', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
            { text: 'LOO', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
            { text: '蒙特卡洛', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
            { text: '5 种子均值', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
            { text: '种子间 SD', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
          ],
          [
            { text: 'LDA_Shrinkage', textStyle: { bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: '0.810', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: '0.812', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: '0.810', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: '0.006', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
          ],
          ['Stacking_Logit', '0.792', '0.810', '0.803', '0.006'],
          ['GaussianProcess_RBF', '0.803', '0.806', '0.796', '0.007'],
          ['SuperLearner_NNLS', '0.796', '0.809', '0.801', '0.009'],
        ]}
      />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 5, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 14, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        LDA_Shrinkage 在 5 个随机种子下<br />全部排名第一
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            LOO 与蒙特卡洛口径下，四个领先模型全部落在 <Text style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>0.79–0.81</Text> 的窄带内——排名对数据划分方式不敏感。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#FFF8E6', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #F0DFA8' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#7A6420', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            Bootstrap 校正揭示过拟合风险：GP / Stacking 的表观 AUC 高达 0.98，校正后仍虚高（0.93–0.95）；而 <Text style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>LDA_Shrinkage 三口径最一致（0.81 / 0.81 / 0.83）</Text>——最"诚实"的模型。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            结论排序不是种子运气：LDA_Shrinkage 种子间 SD 仅 0.006，times_best = 5/5。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB', background: '#F7F9FC' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>南京医科大学第一附属医院 · 心律失常团队</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>13 / 15</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
